WEBVTT

00:14.630 --> 00:19.600
The sweet whispers of love only happen twice.

00:20.880 --> 00:25.970
Before you know it, you're taken prisoner. Chocolat à la folie.

00:27.470 --> 00:32.390
The stardust of dawn is inlaid in the sky.

00:33.850 --> 00:38.820
My emerald eyes have you in their sights!

00:40.250 --> 00:45.030
Sugar Sugar Rune! Choco Choco Rune!

00:46.630 --> 00:51.470
The sparkling hearts are secret jewels.

00:52.950 --> 00:58.220
Even if the boys bully you,

00:59.370 --> 01:04.370
They've just fallen in love. Chocolat à la folie.

01:05.880 --> 01:10.860
They're really in love with you. Chocolat à la folie.

01:23.390 --> 01:25.200
Chocolat à la folie.

01:30.000 --> 01:32.930
This is some intense magic.

01:32.930 --> 01:35.140
Who could she be?

01:35.140 --> 01:39.080
Is it just my imagination,
or do I smell something familiar?

01:44.030 --> 01:47.710
Message from Mama.

01:50.120 --> 01:51.660
Hey...

01:53.580 --> 01:55.960
Please tell me your name.

01:55.960 --> 01:58.330
You are Chocolat Meilleure?

01:58.920 --> 02:01.000
You know who I am?

02:01.460 --> 02:05.590
Everyone knows the name of their
tomboy-ish Queen Candidate.

02:05.590 --> 02:09.940
Besides, they announced your name
earlier, when you first arrived.

02:12.600 --> 02:14.680
What is this scent?

02:14.680 --> 02:17.190
I feel like I've known it for a long time.

02:17.190 --> 02:20.900
It's nostalgic, like an old picture book.

02:20.900 --> 02:22.530
That was refreshing!

02:23.570 --> 02:26.040
You faced those
self-righteous adults,

02:26.040 --> 02:29.000
and said exactly what was on your mind.

02:29.490 --> 02:31.780
Who is this woman?

02:31.780 --> 02:37.290
Why does her voice echo in my heart?

02:37.940 --> 02:42.340
And where have I smelled
that perfume before?

02:42.340 --> 02:44.130
I just can't remember.

02:44.670 --> 02:47.460
Don't ever lose that courage
as you continue onward.

02:48.840 --> 02:50.680
What's that sound?

02:50.680 --> 02:54.390
My my, it seems the Cosmic
Veil couldn't hold out.

02:54.390 --> 02:57.430
Now go, Chocolat. It's your turn to shine.

02:57.890 --> 02:59.070
Eh? Mine?

02:59.690 --> 03:03.770
Being a true Queen means
being able to handle any situation.

03:04.400 --> 03:07.290
A true Queen...?

03:07.650 --> 03:09.110
Run along now!

03:09.110 --> 03:10.740
I understand!

03:15.990 --> 03:17.790
I didn't ask for her name.

03:19.500 --> 03:20.620
She's gone?

03:24.500 --> 03:26.310
What's this?

03:26.710 --> 03:28.880
She left her bracelet behind.

03:30.300 --> 03:31.800
Oh yeah, I gotta go!

03:32.510 --> 03:35.140
I'm sure we'll meet again.

03:37.470 --> 03:39.500
Ruban d'ailes!

03:42.190 --> 03:44.480
Check out the freaky woman!

03:45.840 --> 03:48.740
What's with this string, anyway?

03:48.740 --> 03:51.780
You think you can beat us Ogres with this?

03:52.240 --> 03:54.910
Don't let any more Ogres in!

03:54.910 --> 03:56.220
Go!

04:02.670 --> 04:04.960
They've already started fighting.

04:04.960 --> 04:07.310
How can I calm things down?

04:07.800 --> 04:08.380
Chocolat!

04:08.880 --> 04:10.310
How did this happen?

04:11.050 --> 04:14.970
The Palace Guards advanced,
and the Ogres attacked them.

04:14.970 --> 04:16.010
Ladies and gentlemen.

04:17.050 --> 04:18.640
Captain Glacier is here!

04:18.640 --> 04:22.040
Hurry up and drive those
obnoxious Ogres away!

04:22.480 --> 04:24.810
Leave this place to us.

04:24.810 --> 04:27.520
Please take shelter in the adjoining
room immediately.

04:29.400 --> 04:31.790
You three need to go, too.

04:33.570 --> 04:36.660
Platol is attacking the Ogres.

04:37.240 --> 04:40.040
The Ogres' power is stronger
than it was before.

04:40.540 --> 04:44.080
Perhaps Vanilla becoming their Princess
has re-energized them.

04:44.540 --> 04:46.790
You Ogre scum are an eyesore!

04:46.790 --> 04:48.420
Go back to the Magical World!

04:48.420 --> 04:49.810
Ruban d'ailes!

04:52.810 --> 04:55.310
No, you're the eyesore, Platol.

04:56.510 --> 04:58.970
You're in the presence of the Ogre Princess.

04:58.970 --> 05:00.310
Stand down.

05:00.310 --> 05:01.780
Va-Vanilla-sama?

05:02.270 --> 05:04.730
Shall I teach you a lesson in manners?

05:05.190 --> 05:08.020
Obscurite Cristallisation!

05:13.320 --> 05:14.200
Unthinkable!

05:14.200 --> 05:16.790
Their magic's stronger than
the Palace Guards'.

05:17.280 --> 05:18.530
Vanilla...

05:20.370 --> 05:24.500
They've learned our true power,
and now tremble before it.

05:24.500 --> 05:27.470
Didn't I tell you that we
wouldn't be going anywhere?

05:27.830 --> 05:29.600
You and Le Royaume will disappear.

05:30.340 --> 05:34.090
They've somehow
exploited Noir energy...

05:34.090 --> 05:37.590
and raised their powers
to their maximum limit.

05:37.590 --> 05:39.310
But how?

05:39.760 --> 05:41.890
Unlike other sources of ecure,
Noir is a "Negative Force".

05:41.890 --> 05:46.450
They shouldn't be able to maintain
such high levels of energy.

05:47.020 --> 05:49.270
Damn. How do we fight it?

05:49.860 --> 05:53.000
Look, the battle is escalating.

05:53.000 --> 05:54.650
With their Commander down,

05:54.650 --> 05:56.470
the Palace Guards are attacking
without rhyme or reason.

05:56.950 --> 05:58.530
This is bad.

05:58.530 --> 06:01.450
We're on a path to all-out war with the Ogres.

06:01.950 --> 06:04.480
Was this Pierre's plan from the start?

06:05.000 --> 06:09.250
We won't be able to chase them
away with halfhearted attacks.

06:09.250 --> 06:11.460
Let's end this in one strike, Robin.

06:11.460 --> 06:14.170
But Vanilla is with them.

06:14.170 --> 06:15.460
It's too risky.

06:15.460 --> 06:19.180
At this rate, we won't lose just
Vanilla, but Chocolat as well.

06:21.260 --> 06:22.890
We can't let that happen.

06:22.890 --> 06:26.680
If both Queen Candidates are lost,
Le Royauxne has no future.

06:27.230 --> 06:31.400
You still don't know the true
power of the Noir side.

06:31.400 --> 06:33.980
We were persecuted by Le Royaume,
and left with no choice...

06:33.980 --> 06:36.940
but to use the
forbidden Noir hearts.

06:36.940 --> 06:40.990
You will know the suffering and sadness
we Ogres have experienced!

06:46.160 --> 06:47.010
Robin!

06:47.370 --> 06:48.620
I know.

06:48.620 --> 06:49.720
Let's do it, Glacier.

06:52.130 --> 06:53.250
Amazing!

06:53.250 --> 06:57.260
Robin~sensei and Captain Glacier
are both getting serious!

06:57.260 --> 06:58.400
What's this?

06:58.400 --> 07:00.800
What're you doing, Captain Glacier!

07:00.800 --> 07:01.590
Robin!

07:01.590 --> 07:03.090
Stay away, Chocolat!

07:03.640 --> 07:07.310
If we can drive the Ogres away,
the fighting will stop!

07:10.060 --> 07:12.400
Those who are born from the Darkness...

07:12.400 --> 07:15.230
Recoil from our Shield of Light,
and leave this place!

07:17.150 --> 07:17.990
Oh no!

07:17.990 --> 07:19.700
White energy is headed this way!

07:19.700 --> 07:22.210
This is bad... those two are super-strong!

07:25.080 --> 07:28.290
They're using massive amounts of magic.

07:28.790 --> 07:30.530
Vanilla... Pierre...!

07:30.530 --> 07:34.670
Pierre may be strong,
but he can't stand up to this.

07:34.670 --> 07:35.380
We must flee!

07:35.380 --> 07:36.940
Your bodies will melt!

07:37.590 --> 07:40.090
Please stop, Glacier, Robin!

07:40.880 --> 07:43.130
Can't you hear me?!

07:46.080 --> 07:47.470
Robin!!

07:47.470 --> 07:49.480
Being a Queen candidate means...

07:49.480 --> 07:52.480
prioritizing the Magical World's welfare,

07:52.480 --> 07:55.770
even if it means losing a friend.

07:56.320 --> 07:57.080
No...

07:57.730 --> 07:59.280
Chocolat, get out of the way!

07:59.820 --> 08:02.130
It wasn't supposed to be like this!

08:03.700 --> 08:06.410
Etoile Eclair!

08:09.410 --> 08:10.640
In that case...

08:11.400 --> 08:12.140
Chocolat!

08:15.640 --> 08:17.640
I'll use all my magic...

08:17.640 --> 08:19.430
to protect Vanilla!

08:19.920 --> 08:22.420
Sugar Sugar Rune! Choco Rune!

08:47.700 --> 08:49.120
You're so reckless, ribbit.

08:49.120 --> 08:50.290
Oopsie!

08:50.290 --> 08:51.290
Chocolat!

08:54.120 --> 08:55.920
Where are we?

08:55.920 --> 08:57.000
Chocolat!

08:57.000 --> 08:58.250
Saule!

08:58.250 --> 08:59.500
Chocolat!

09:01.340 --> 09:02.810
You're all right?

09:03.260 --> 09:04.720
Why did you interfere?

09:04.720 --> 09:07.020
Because you two are stupid!

09:07.430 --> 09:08.850
Chocolat...

09:08.850 --> 09:11.530
I know you were
trying to protect us.

09:12.220 --> 09:15.890
But if it means hurting Vanilla this much...

09:15.890 --> 09:17.530
then I don't want to be Queen!

09:18.110 --> 09:20.650
Chocolat, I thought I told you...

09:20.650 --> 09:22.400
"Being a Queen candidate means...

09:22.400 --> 09:24.030
prioritizing the Magical World's welfare,

09:24.030 --> 09:27.490
even if it means losing a friend."

09:27.490 --> 09:29.620
Are you talking about my mama, Robin?

09:30.990 --> 09:34.800
And how Queen Candy became
Queen after Mama died?

09:35.370 --> 09:36.800
Well, she...

09:38.380 --> 09:39.800
I can't allow that.

09:40.170 --> 09:41.810
I just can't!

09:41.810 --> 09:42.710
Chocolat!

09:42.710 --> 09:44.010
Where are you going?

09:44.010 --> 09:45.720
I'm going to look for those two.

09:45.720 --> 09:46.840
But it's dangerous,

09:46.840 --> 09:49.010
what with all the Ogres that might
be lurking around here.

09:49.970 --> 09:51.680
Then I'll use this!

09:53.310 --> 09:54.520
She disappeared?

09:54.520 --> 09:57.030
It's the Invisibility Crystal she
bought from the catalog.

09:57.440 --> 10:00.150
It looks like Pierre and Vanilla
have managed to escape.

10:00.810 --> 10:02.570
This is for the best.

10:03.530 --> 10:06.040
The Queen doesn't want to fight.

10:06.780 --> 10:08.070
Robin...

10:08.070 --> 10:11.030
We were about to make a big mistake.

10:11.780 --> 10:14.040
Chocolat saved us from ourselves.

10:24.630 --> 10:26.070
Vanilla...

10:26.510 --> 10:29.340
That's right, she made a clean getaway.

10:30.550 --> 10:32.050
Congelation!

10:32.640 --> 10:35.260
Etoile Eclair!

10:41.770 --> 10:44.060
Sugar Sugar Rune! Choco Rune!

10:50.450 --> 10:51.460
Juiliet!

10:59.120 --> 11:03.170
Chocolat's magic lessened the shock.

11:04.750 --> 11:06.380
What a disgrace.

11:09.340 --> 11:11.150
I'm supposed to be the Ogre Prince!

11:12.140 --> 11:16.270
I'm supposed to be powerful, not powerless.

11:16.270 --> 11:18.160
I memorized the cursed words...

11:18.850 --> 11:22.520
and made my heart as cold as ice.

11:22.520 --> 11:25.730
I thought I'd done away with my kind heart
and feelings of companionship.

11:25.730 --> 11:29.160
But all of a sudden, my heart became frail,
and I felt like I wanted to cry.

11:31.970 --> 11:36.080
Despair... is that the source of my strength?

11:36.580 --> 11:38.410
I can't be defeated!

11:38.410 --> 11:42.120
Not until they stop calling us Ogres
and walking all over us.

11:46.460 --> 11:49.260
Pierre, are you hurt?

11:49.260 --> 11:51.100
How's Vanilla?

11:51.100 --> 11:54.640
I need power, and more of it.

11:56.810 --> 11:58.430
Pierre's tears...

11:59.220 --> 12:03.190
They look like shards of ice. Why?

12:03.190 --> 12:05.480
Why is he so sad?

12:10.820 --> 12:12.530
Pierre...!

12:12.530 --> 12:13.710
Who's that?

12:14.530 --> 12:16.570
What am I doing?

12:17.080 --> 12:18.660
I smell chocolate...

12:18.660 --> 12:20.410
Chocolat? Is that you?

12:23.710 --> 12:26.220
That presence suddenly disappeared.

12:26.220 --> 12:30.800
Chocolat, I thought you were here with me.

12:34.380 --> 12:38.100
Why... why have you entered my heart?

12:38.100 --> 12:41.430
And just when I'd managed
to co-exist with the Noir.

12:41.430 --> 12:44.210
Why can she
make my heart waver?

12:47.360 --> 12:51.210
Chocolat, I'm the Ogre Prince.

12:51.210 --> 12:53.690
That's why I can't let you exist within me.

12:55.030 --> 12:57.700
Don't go stirring
up my heart, please.

12:58.740 --> 13:02.700
What possessed me
to embrace Pierre like that?

13:03.500 --> 13:06.230
My heart's starting to hurt more and more.

13:09.210 --> 13:11.550
The Ogres came to Walpurgis?

13:11.550 --> 13:13.130
My sincerest apologies.

13:13.130 --> 13:18.140
The Ogres' power was
more immense than we'd imagined.

13:18.470 --> 13:21.250
I have felt that as well.

13:21.250 --> 13:25.240
So Vanilla attended with the Ogre Prince?

13:25.730 --> 13:30.650
Yes, and Vanilla-sama was hurt
when the fighting broke out.

13:30.650 --> 13:34.240
Captain Glacier, I don't wish to fight.

13:34.690 --> 13:40.080
Come what may, promise me that
you won't fight the Ogres again.

13:40.080 --> 13:44.750
But at this rate, the Ogres will continue
to expand their territory.

13:44.750 --> 13:49.250
The Human World, and even
Le Royaume itself will be in peril.

13:49.750 --> 13:52.500
I will temporarily close the Moon Door...

13:52.500 --> 13:54.630
between the Magical and Human Worlds.

13:54.630 --> 13:56.680
That should buy us some time.

13:56.680 --> 14:00.470
Meanwhile, I will consult with the Senate.

14:01.140 --> 14:02.470
Yes my Queen.

14:05.060 --> 14:08.900
Chocolat-chan used her
magic to protect me...

14:08.900 --> 14:11.620
despite all the mean things I said to her.

14:12.070 --> 14:15.230
Why? How can she be so kind?

14:20.200 --> 14:22.580
I'm glad you're safe, Vanilla.

14:24.410 --> 14:27.410
What am I saying?

14:27.410 --> 14:30.540
I'm talking like a soft-hearted human.

14:31.080 --> 14:33.540
I'll keep whispering the cursed words.

14:34.050 --> 14:37.920
They'll protect my heart.

14:37.920 --> 14:40.330
I can't let warm blood
flow through it.

14:41.390 --> 14:42.800
Pierre-sama...

14:43.560 --> 14:45.510
He's calling for you.

14:47.310 --> 14:49.020
Understood.

14:51.690 --> 14:54.770
And here I thought I hated him.

14:54.770 --> 15:00.490
He's made Vanilla suffer,
and he's even tried to kill me!

15:00.490 --> 15:04.280
So why do I feel like this
when I think about Pierre?

15:05.160 --> 15:07.750
Chocolat! I heard everything
from Houx and Saule!

15:07.750 --> 15:09.290
You shouldn't be so reckless!

15:09.750 --> 15:10.830
Shut up!

15:14.720 --> 15:16.300
Ah, that's...

15:16.300 --> 15:18.520
Where did you find this?

15:19.130 --> 15:21.510
I picked it up at the Night of Walpurgis.

15:22.090 --> 15:25.540
That's right, I never did
find that woman again.

15:26.010 --> 15:28.530
Chocolat, this is an incredible item!

15:29.520 --> 15:32.310
It's a magical artifact passed down
through the royal family...

15:32.310 --> 15:33.520
a Heart Bangle!

15:34.060 --> 15:36.780
You can summon any object...

15:36.780 --> 15:40.030
that doesn't exist in this World via the ring.

15:40.780 --> 15:43.040
Something that doesn't exist in this world?

15:43.450 --> 15:45.750
It's a key that doesn't exist in this world.

15:46.830 --> 15:48.550
The key to Mama's diary!

15:49.000 --> 15:52.670
Strange things happen on
the Night of Walpurgis.

15:52.670 --> 15:56.260
I'm sure your late mother sent this to you.

15:56.880 --> 15:59.000
It might be from Mama...

15:59.510 --> 16:02.590
All right! Sugar Sugar Rune! Choco Rune!

16:02.590 --> 16:05.340
Appear, key to Mama's diary! Attrape!

16:09.020 --> 16:10.980
The key appeared!

16:10.980 --> 16:12.640
Open the diary!

16:12.640 --> 16:13.360
I will!

16:15.770 --> 16:18.980
I'm opening... Mama's diary.

16:22.530 --> 16:25.460
This belongs to Cinammon Meilleure.

16:25.460 --> 16:27.420
Strangers are not permitted to read it.

16:27.830 --> 16:32.460
I'm not a stranger! I'm her daughter,
Chocolat Meilleure.

16:32.460 --> 16:34.500
Can you prove it?

16:34.500 --> 16:36.540
I'll imitate Gramps.

16:36.540 --> 16:39.170
And by "Gramps," I mean Cinammon's dad.

16:39.170 --> 16:42.420
What's with ya, kid? Ya doin' all right?

16:43.300 --> 16:44.510
A dead ringer...

16:44.510 --> 16:47.260
Very well. I will recognize you
as Chocolat Meilleure.

16:47.260 --> 16:49.220
That's really all it takes?!

16:54.940 --> 16:59.760
It's been four days since I came to the Human
World with Candy for the Queen Selection Exam.

16:59.760 --> 17:01.570
I got five hearts today.

17:01.570 --> 17:05.320
Adolph the foreign exchange student, Takada-kun, Tsuyoshi, Hakase-kun...

17:05.320 --> 17:08.670
Cool, Mama really was popular.

17:08.670 --> 17:12.200
And Goro, who falls more in
love with me every day.

17:12.200 --> 17:15.830
In fact, me taking his heart every
day landed him in the hospital.

17:15.830 --> 17:19.380
Seems like even humans are weakened from having their hearts repeatedly taken.

17:19.840 --> 17:23.340
Wow, Mama did the exact same thing I did.

17:23.340 --> 17:27.720
Lately, I've been talking about the
Magical World with Candy.

17:27.720 --> 17:29.730
She wrote about Queen Candy, too.

17:31.100 --> 17:35.020
Le Royaume and the Ogres
are in a long-standing deadlock.

17:35.020 --> 17:39.810
Today, Le Royaume once again
repulsed the advances of the Ogres.

17:39.810 --> 17:42.900
Everyone's ecstatic about this "victory."

17:42.900 --> 17:46.280
But nothing good comes from fighting.

17:46.280 --> 17:49.160
Candy and I agree that...

17:49.160 --> 17:52.700
we wish to end the conflict
between Le Royaume and the Ogres.

17:52.700 --> 17:55.370
We just don't know how to accomplish it.

17:55.830 --> 17:59.210
Mama was stressed out about the Ogres, too.

17:59.210 --> 18:01.340
Two years since we came
to the Human World...

18:01.340 --> 18:03.920
I've been chosen as the next Queen.

18:03.920 --> 18:05.930
Eh? Mama became Queen?

18:06.340 --> 18:10.680
Candy was afraid that humans would
get weak if she took their hearts.

18:10.680 --> 18:14.180
Even though tons of men
were in love with her.

18:14.180 --> 18:17.940
So I won the battle to become
the next Queen.

18:18.310 --> 18:22.360
How nice. You're better-suited
to be the next Queen.

18:22.360 --> 18:23.980
Thank you, Candy!

18:23.980 --> 18:29.700
But I plan to support your
efforts to stop the war.

18:30.910 --> 18:33.420
Don't forget those words...

18:33.870 --> 18:37.250
And then, the two of us got
married side-by-side.

18:37.250 --> 18:41.790
We'd always been together,
right up to the wedding ceremonies.

18:42.840 --> 18:48.510
Candy named her child "Vanilla,"
and I called mine "Chocolat."

18:48.510 --> 18:53.480
Ah, Chocolat... you were such
a cute and darling baby.

18:53.810 --> 18:59.450
You taught me just how precious
the existence of another could be.

19:00.600 --> 19:01.990
Mama...

19:02.480 --> 19:05.650
Day by day, Chocolat grew up.

19:05.650 --> 19:08.990
But that was when the Ogres
obtained a great power.

19:08.990 --> 19:12.870
And the fighting between them
and Le Royaume resumed.

19:12.870 --> 19:15.080
They'd been driven to the
fringes of the world.

19:15.080 --> 19:20.370
Unable to acquire ecure, they laid
their hands on the forbidden Noir.

19:20.370 --> 19:25.010
Noir... the Energy of Darkness,
not used by Le Royaume.

19:25.550 --> 19:28.550
A negative power that eats away at the soul.

19:28.550 --> 19:33.970
Merely touching Noir would cause
normal mages to lose their lives.

19:33.970 --> 19:39.030
The Ogres intended to use the power
of Noir to lay waste to Le Royaume.

19:39.520 --> 19:43.060
The day when I would officially become Queen was fast approaching.

19:43.060 --> 19:48.940
"If I became queen, I'd no longer
be able to speak or act freely."

19:48.940 --> 19:52.700
The fighting with the Ogres
intensified even more.

19:52.700 --> 19:55.320
I made up my mind.

19:56.220 --> 19:58.120
What's on your mind?

19:58.120 --> 20:03.420
Are you serious about giving up
everything to end this war?

20:03.420 --> 20:04.630
Of course I am!

20:04.630 --> 20:08.500
Good to hear. The truth is,
I have a favor to ask of you.

20:08.500 --> 20:11.820
What is it? You know I can't
refuse a request from the Queen.

20:12.260 --> 20:14.300
I'm going to the land of the Ogres...

20:15.010 --> 20:17.300
in order to quell this conflict.

20:18.180 --> 20:22.270
Do you understand, Candy?
If I don't come back...

20:22.270 --> 20:24.390
you must become Queen!

20:26.020 --> 20:27.770
Cinammon...

20:31.880 --> 20:35.490
Chocolat, you were more important
to me than anything.

20:35.490 --> 20:40.890
Leaving you behind was
the hardest thing I ever had to do.

20:40.890 --> 20:44.870
I had to save the lives
that would have been lost in the war.

20:44.870 --> 20:46.750
Most of all yours, Chocolat.

20:47.250 --> 20:51.600
I will go to Glace, for the sake of your future.

21:01.770 --> 21:04.390
Robin, there's Noir power headed this way!

21:04.390 --> 21:05.480
Get away!

21:05.480 --> 21:06.140
But...!

21:07.440 --> 21:08.680
Stand down, all of you!

21:09.110 --> 21:09.980
That's...

21:21.040 --> 21:22.950
What just happened?

21:22.950 --> 21:25.620
The Noir energy is being purified.

21:25.620 --> 21:28.750
This scent... Cinammon's fragrance...

21:28.750 --> 21:29.980
has disappeared.

21:30.540 --> 21:35.230
Cinammon, the next Queen,
did this to save us all.

21:36.680 --> 21:41.140
This is... the power of Filtre.

21:47.350 --> 21:50.860
Glace... the young noble of Ice and Snow.

21:52.190 --> 21:56.620
The great wizard exiled from Le Royaume...

21:59.450 --> 22:00.620
You called for me?

22:02.500 --> 22:04.990
Pierre...

22:05.910 --> 22:06.960
Yes.

22:23.570 --> 22:26.070
That girl is good and this girl is good too

22:26.070 --> 22:27.720
It's so very hard to choose

22:28.740 --> 22:31.410
That guy is bad and this guy is bad

22:31.410 --> 22:32.960
Jealousy will drive them mad

22:36.670 --> 22:39.330
Dresses are nice, ribbons are nice too

22:39.330 --> 22:40.920
Blue jeans just won't do!

22:42.000 --> 22:44.630
How about a kiss, what about tomorrow?

22:44.630 --> 22:46.340
"I will not let you go home"

22:50.350 --> 22:52.510
Why is it that all boys

22:52.510 --> 22:54.510
are always the same

22:54.510 --> 22:58.310
and drive me up the wall?

22:58.310 --> 23:01.980
I don't get them at all

23:08.660 --> 23:11.320
Making big plans and going on dates

23:11.320 --> 23:13.000
from one town to the next

23:13.950 --> 23:16.710
Sitting on swingsets, staying up real late

23:16.710 --> 23:18.370
having our little chats

23:22.040 --> 23:24.670
Whispering voices, in between the bedsheets

23:24.670 --> 23:26.300
Little kisses are so sweet

23:27.350 --> 23:30.010
Somebody kill the lights in the room, cause

23:30.010 --> 23:31.470
Mama's gonna wake up soon

23:32.640 --> 23:35.220
Somebody kill the lights in the room, cause

23:35.220 --> 23:37.020
Mama's gonna wake up soon

23:38.020 --> 23:39.770
Mama's gonna wake up soon

23:40.690 --> 23:42.360
Mama's gonna wake up soon

23:47.730 --> 23:50.530
Vanilla's collecting boys?

23:50.530 --> 23:52.530
What's she planning to do with them?

23:52.530 --> 23:56.110
Huh? They've all got black hearts in their chests!

23:56.110 --> 23:57.880
Don't do this anymore, Vanilla!

23:57.880 --> 24:01.280
If you keep gathering Noir, you'll die!

24:01.280 --> 24:05.300
Somebody tell me how to turn Vanilla back to normal!

24:05.300 --> 24:07.490
Next time on Sugar Sugar Rune:

24:07.490 --> 24:10.800
Pierre's Scheme, Vanilla's Heart.

24:10.800 --> 24:12.800
Not watching?
That's a butt-whupping.

24:12.800 --> 24:13.800
Thanks!
